            "block_content": "The provisions of this contract shall apply to all Employees, including those who are on loan to (a) Company organizations other than the installation Field forces of the Company or (b) to other companies, provided they remain on the payroll of the installation Organization. To the extent there is any conflict between the terms of Article 26, on the one hand, and the terms of CWA-24 and Appendices 1, 2, and 3 on the other, the terms of Article 26 will control.",
